  "description": "A story of love and humanity, following four boys and girls trying to live their best lives through hardship and turmoil, in a small town on a private rail line just outside of Shinjuku. Minor misunderstandings lead to big complications, and their various feelings become entangled.<br>\n<br>\nA story of daily life lived 49% looking back, 51% looking forward.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll)",
