        "description": "__Height:__ 153 cm\n\nA high school dropout because her school didn't approve of her working at Milk Hall, a cafe and bar, since they serve alcohol in the evening. She has feelings for [Rikuo](https://anilist.co/character/69339/Uozumi-Rikuo) and frequently visits him at his part time job at the convenience store.\n\nOften seen with her pet crow, [Kansuke](https://anilist.co/character/180177/Kansuke).",
