        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b69339-OlIJAIbrQOxU.png"
        },
        "description": "Rikuo is a university graduate who has a passion for photography, but lacks motivation to find a career in life. He works part time at a convenience store to pay for his rent and living utilities. Rikuo has feelings for [Shinako](https://anilist.co/character/68127/Shinako-Morinome) ever since their university days.\n\nHe works at Nico2 Mart four days a week. [Haru](https://anilist.co/character/11766/Haru-Nonaka) claims that she knew him for a long time, but he has no recollection of her. He has a past that he doesn't want to remember. ~!He consistently treats Haru coldly, saying he doesn't know her or want any part of her, despite actually being unable to get her off his mind.!~\n\n(Source: Yesterday wo Utatte Wiki)",
